Vendored Beam bvm2 contract processor

Upstream:  https://github.com/BeamMW/beam
Commit:    daf7191567b746953e6e7a8d72d4396b6d4c94f5
Paths:     bvm/ and utility/ (subset)
License:   Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE-APACHE and the repository NOTICE

Modified (each carries a "Modified by the Qwertycoin developers" line under the upstream header):
  bvm2.h bvm2.cpp bvm2_opcodes.h bvm2_shared.h common.h common.cpp
  wasm_interpreter.h wasm_interpreter.cpp byteorder.h containers.h

Ported (H-19, H-21):
  wasm interpreter and compiler, integer only (H-22)
  contract processor: far calls, heap, vars, logs, hashing, CryptoNote signature check
  FundsLock / FundsUnlock against the call deposit
  AddSig key collection with subgroup checks, deduplication, and caller provenance
  parent header host call: parent hash, parent header, current height
  app shader compile kind (Common + App tables, no Contract table), App::IHost, document and variable-read host calls (wallet-side only)
  app generated call signer requests, DerivePk, and wallet authorization

Not ported:
  asset emission and asset ownership
  Lelantus, shielded pools, DH, secp256k1 and elliptic curve host calls
  bridge, PBFT, sidechain and DAO vault host calls
  Beam wallet manager, kernel and tx integration

Integration lives one level up in src/vm (host_api, gas, limits, state_tree, vm).
Call signature wire format and wallet flow: docs/CONTRACT_SIGNATURES.md.
